<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CalEnergy Co Inc restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CalEnergy Co Inc restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Boston said it reinstated coverage of CalEnergy Co Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- CalEnergy lost 5/8 to 36 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
